      "value": "You can't select another dedication feat until you've gained two other feats from the Sixth Pillar archetype.\nLeads to: Maneuvering Spell|FRP2, Six Pillars Stance|FRP2, Sixth Pillar Mastery|FRP2, Touch Focus|FRP2"
